+++ b/docs/api.rst
@@ -444,6 +444,14 @@ Here a list of the builtin loaders Jinja provides:
 
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.FileSystemLoader
 
+``FileSystemLoader`` accepts ``expand_searchpath=True`` to expand
+environment variables followed by user-home markers when it is created.
+The default keeps paths literal. Path-like entries are converted
+before expansion. Undefined variables follow the host's ``expandvars``
+behavior. The stored paths do not change when the environment changes.
+Relative paths remain relative to the working directory during lookup;
+ordering, encoding, freshness, and template listing remain supported.
+
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.PackageLoader
 
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.DictLoader
